          "type": "text",
          "text": "Triangles ABC and XYZ are congruent, with A, B and C corresponding to X, Y and Z. AB = (2k + 1) cm, XY = 13 cm and YZ = (k + 4) cm. Find the length of BC in cm. Enter the numerical value only."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 2,
      "primary_outcome": "2.1",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
        "type": "numeric",
